{
  "_comment": [
    "Language-neutral contract for the action-trace snapshot diff.",
    "",
    "Kotlin (dev.reticle.core.trace.ActionTraceDiff, used by the Android helper)",
    "and Swift (ActionTraceDiff in reticle-host/Sources/ReticleHostIos, used by",
    "the iOS host) are hand-written 1:1 ports. This table is what stops them",
    "drifting: both suites read it and must produce the listed change list, in",
    "the listed order, field for field.",
    "",
    "The rules being pinned:",
    "  - ranking: present < text/label/enabled/visible < identity/affordance <",
    "    the geometry-and-counts tail. The cap spends its budget top-down, so a",
    "    scrolling list's frame churn can no longer truncate away the one node",
    "    that appeared.",
    "  - naming: the first surviving change for a ref carries that node's",
    "    identity, read from whichever side it exists on. Later changes on the",
    "    same ref do not repeat it.",
    "  - anonymity: a node with no testId/resourceId/label is identified by its",
    "    text, collapsed to one line and clipped at 60 CODE POINTS (not UTF-16",
    "    units, not grapheme clusters — the two platforms disagree by default).",
    "  - truncation: the marker states total, kept, and which fields were shed."
  ],
  "_recordedParamsComment": [
    "The allow-list of request keys an action trace records under `params`, in",
    "the order a manifest and a digest list them. Pinned here because it exists",
    "twice by hand — dev.reticle.core.trace.ActionTraceParams.RECORDED and Swift's",
    "ActionTraceParamNames.recorded — and a key added to one side only would make",
    "the same gesture record differently on Android and iOS.",
    "",
    "`text` is on this list deliberately: a type action's result records only a",
    "character count, so without it no trace can ever say what was typed. Nothing",
    "in the capture layer marks a field secure — see docs/boundaries.md."
  ],
  "recordedParams": [
    "text",
    "submit",
    "typeDelayMs",
    "settle",
    "noSettle",
    "settleTimeoutMs",
    "from",
    "to",
    "duration",
    "container",
    "direction",
    "maxSwipes",
    "verify",
    "verifyTimeoutMs",
    "for",
    "gone",
    "idle",
    "textContains",
    "timeoutMs",
    "quietMs"
  ],
